# Clerk CLI agent skills: regenerable via `clerk init`, machine-local tooling
# rather than application code, and they carry scripts that run with agent
# permissions. Kept out of the branch so they are an explicit choice per
# machine rather than something inherited silently by whoever clones next.
.agents/
skills-lock.json
# .claude/skills entries are symlinks into .agents, so committing them would
# leave dangling links in every fresh clone.
.claude/skills/
